{"5086720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Embrace Of The Embers", "steam_appid": 5086720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome home, Arthur:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains a large amount of grotesque blood, and horror and thriller elements. Players with weak psychological endurance should play with caution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Embrace of Embers&quot; is a simulated interactive cinematic game that combines dark fantasy and psychological horror. The game features an open-ended narrative with multiple branches and endings, and each of your choices could determine the ultimate fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/db4228b61e4db4dcf4df7bbf6f6a94a3.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/db4228b61e4db4dcf4df7bbf6f6a94a3.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur, who awakens in an unfamiliar room filled with signs of fire damage. Outside the room, strange footsteps and the dragging of heavy objects can be constantly heard, and a sense of danger permeates the surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/cbe9ab9aef00a57c5d6a8af65567e515.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/cbe9ab9aef00a57c5d6a8af65567e515.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must explore every corner of this eerie house, avoid deadly traps, and search for key items that can awaken fragments of your memory, unraveling the truth of the events that occurred in this burned house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/a369ae6a08b69471e629323506c488c7.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/a369ae6a08b69471e629323506c488c7.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And your family may become the greatest obstacle on this journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/14d18ba554b1d83660e6703eeeb2cbe2.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/14d18ba554b1d83660e6703eeeb2cbe2.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of continuous attempts, your memory will gradually reorganize, and ultimately, you will personally uncover the truth of the event that spanned five years and altered the fate of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome home, Arthur:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains a large amount of grotesque blood, and horror and thriller elements. Players with weak psychological endurance should play with caution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Embrace of Embers&quot; is a simulated interactive cinematic game that combines dark fantasy and psychological horror. The game features an open-ended narrative with multiple branches and endings, and each of your choices could determine the ultimate fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/db4228b61e4db4dcf4df7bbf6f6a94a3.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/db4228b61e4db4dcf4df7bbf6f6a94a3.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur, who awakens in an unfamiliar room filled with signs of fire damage. Outside the room, strange footsteps and the dragging of heavy objects can be constantly heard, and a sense of danger permeates the surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/cbe9ab9aef00a57c5d6a8af65567e515.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/cbe9ab9aef00a57c5d6a8af65567e515.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must explore every corner of this eerie house, avoid deadly traps, and search for key items that can awaken fragments of your memory, unraveling the truth of the events that occurred in this burned house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/a369ae6a08b69471e629323506c488c7.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/a369ae6a08b69471e629323506c488c7.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And your family may become the greatest obstacle on this journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras/14d18ba554b1d83660e6703eeeb2cbe2.avif?t=1787369436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/extras_big/14d18ba554b1d83660e6703eeeb2cbe2.avif?t=1787369436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of continuous attempts, your memory will gradually reorganize, and ultimately, you will personally uncover the truth of the event that spanned five years and altered the fate of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Remember, what you see may not be real; what you believe may not be correct. This is not just an adventure to escape a nightmare, but also a journey questioning love, guilt, and loss. Welcome home, Arthur.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/df5149ae2e64fe0b6558b0c1ace22b043a64d7d5/header.jpg?t=1787369436", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/4546328d1643b6af33c46dadb1e9a1a5726fd6d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787369436", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086720/4546328d1643b6af33c46dadb1e9a1a5726fd6d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787369436", "website": "https://avggames.com/EmbraceOfTheEmber/official-website", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 / AMD A6 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 独立显卡<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5或AMD equivalent或以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro